        {
          "text": "kuti muyoowe Jehova Leza wanu, mubambe imbeta zyakwe zyoonse amilazyo yakwe yoonse njendamulailila, nywebo abana banu abana babana banu, mazuba oonse aabuumi bwanu, kuti muongole. ",
