              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkaambo Jehova Leza wanu uukede akati kanu ngu-Leza sibuzuba; kuti bukali bwa-Jehova butamubukili, atamunyonyooni ansi. ",
          "type": "text",
